      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785818703226,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirement\n1) Query availability by location (inside 1 hour delivery)\n2) Order items\n\n\nNon-functional requirement\n1) Connect to any DC (distribution center) within 1 hour\n2) Fast (100ms) for availability\n3) Consistency\n4) 10k DCs, 100k items in catalog\n5) Order volume (10m orders/day)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirement\n1) Query availability by location (inside 1 hour delivery)\n2) Order items\n\n\nNon-functional requirement\n1) Connect to any DC (distribution center) within 1 hour\n2) Fast (100ms) for availability\n3) Consistency\n4) 10k DCs, 100k items in catalog\n5) Order volume (10m orders/day)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
