      "seed": 211332573,
      "version": 88,
      "versionNonce": 1773572243,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785820278368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Use travel time estimation service against nearby DCs\n- Sync periodically (like every 5 minutes) from a DC table \nto memory of our service. When an input comes in, \nwe can prune down the \"candidate\" DCs by taking a fixed radius  (eg: 60 miles, 1hours) \nand limiting ourselves to only evaluating those.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Use travel time estimation service against nearby DCs\n- Sync periodically (like every 5 minutes) from a DC table \nto memory of our service. When an input comes in, \nwe can prune down the \"candidate\" DCs by taking a fixed radius  (eg: 60 miles, 1hours) \nand limiting ourselves to only evaluating those.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
